A '''Grand Duchess''' (Japanese: '''グランダッチェス''' ''Grand Duchess'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that debuted in [[Generation VI]]. This Trainer class is a title of nobility, granted in the [[Battle Chateau]], and Trainers with this class only appear there. Grand Duchess is the highest rank of nobility for women, ranking above {{tc|Duchess}}. They are the female counterparts of the {{tc|Grand Duke}} class.

The female [[player character]] may earn the title of Grand Duchess by defeating most of the Trainers in the Battle Chateau. [[Diantha]] is the only non-player character who uses this Trainer class. She can be battled after the player has reached the rank of Grand Duke/Grand Duchess in the Battle Chateau.

